+##### significantDigits
+
+Type: `number`\
+Default: `3`
+
+The number of significant digits to round to.
+
+Only applies when `minimumFractionDigits` and `maximumFractionDigits` are not set. An invalid value (anything but an integer between 1 and 100) is ignored and the default is used.
+
